Development moved to this repository on 2026-11-03. Its first commit imports
the project from a private development repository. Commit ids, branch names
(such as origin/...) and ignored data/ paths cited in evidence, receipts and
documents written before then refer to that private history and its local
inputs, which are not published. Execution hosts and home directories are named
by placeholders (build-host, remote-host, workstation-host, /home/operator,
and ~/ for a home directory). Where the import changed a file (host and path
placeholders, resource names, links), digests cited for that file refer to its
private bytes. The exception is the files whose home paths the import removed
(pinned detector and experiment records, and the dataset record files and
capture audit noted in datasets/README.md): their checksums, sizes and record
digests were updated wherever they are cited, together with the digests of the
files that cite them. Release bundles and model weights cited as releases are not part of
this repository.

